{"id":1734,"name":"Macross 7","slug":"macross_7","synopsis":"35 years have passed since Lynn Minmay had brought peace between the Zentradi and the humans in the events of Macross. Nekki Basara is a guitarist and a singer of the band Fire Bomber. Living in a less-developed part of the flying colony City 7 which is looking for a habitable planet, he composes and sings songs in the belief that music holds a greater power.\n\nDuring its flight, an unknown alien race appeared and started laying siege upon City 7. However, its attacks are not conventional -- instead of trying to destroy them, they steal what is known as \"spiritia\", rendering victims unresponsive and zombie-like. During these battles, Basara always goes out into the middle of the warzone, singing his songs and expecting friend and foe to listen and be moved by his music.\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":1994,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:10","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 04:53:08","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":1397},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":1397},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":1250},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":442},{"site":"ANN","externalId":940},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":1203}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":3459,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/VU449braNx5Fr3949Trct1sK8lCJjkUkr9PrXmfE.png"},{"id":3460,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/rjotevMw5ep7yYw9sODqCtBNrDdp3zlj2OwHhxYx.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":104,"name":"Production Reed","slug":"production_reed"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":101,"name":"Macross","slug":"macross"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":838,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":838,"title":"Seventh Moon","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":920,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":13218,"basename":"Macross7-OP1.webm","filename":"Macross7-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/Macross7-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm","size":3752